        {
          "path": "_m/g/c/x/q/saltburn-by-the-sea-wk/saltburn-by-the-sea-banner-pie.jpg",
          "filename": "Saltburn-by-the-Sea banner pier.jpg",
          "caption": "I have been itching to go out and do a shoot for a while now. The equipment in my bag has been feeling underused, so this morning I got up at 5.30am and headed to the east coast. The weather looked promising, and I set my course for Saltburn-by-the-Sea, near Middlesbrough. The pier there is a favourite for togs, and I was hoping for some nice light. I was rewarded with some lovely pastel shades about 30 to 20 minutes before sunrise, and it was nice and quiet. Here's my first shot from on the pier itself.",
          "alt": "I have been itching to go out and do a shoot for a while now. The equipment in my bag has been feeling underused, so this morning I got up at 5.30am and headed to the east coast. The weather looked promising, and I set my course for Saltburn-by-the-Sea, near Middlesbrough. The pier there is a favourite for togs, and I was hoping for some nice light. I was rewarded with some lovely pastel shades about 30 to 20 minutes before sunrise, and it was nice and quiet. Here's my first shot from on the pier itself.",
          "width": 5919,
          "height": 846,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "Chris Combe from York, UK",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saltburn-by-the-Sea_banner_pier.jpg",
          "sourceType": "poi",
          "sourceArticleId": "saltburn-by-the-sea-wk",
